              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "FSUGABRIELLE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a delicious recipe which is easy to make. I chose to substitue Tzatziki sauce (also from allrecipes) for the oil and vinegar dressing, which I served on the side. I also added kalamata olives. It was great!"
          },
          {
