              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "bethg"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made a lot of changes to the recipe. I used olive oil with pomegranate vinegar, and in greater proportions of vinegar to oil. I cut up English cucumbers and halved grape tomatoes, more kalamata olives, and every color bell peppers. Plus oregano and red onion.",
            "datePublished": "2016-07-04T21:36:21.220Z"
          },
          {
