            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Maureen Fipke"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I use whole grape tomatoes, sliced black olives and bottle Greek Feta &amp; Oregano dressing by Kraft along with cucumbers and crumbled or shaved Feta cheese. Leave out green peppers but use red, yellow, orange and red. Can also substitute red onion for diced white.",
            "datePublished": "2012-05-13T13:31:03.860Z"
          },
          {
